<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firm buys 12,000 T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firm buys 12,000 T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine firm bought 12,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for November 24 shipment, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The transaction was made through a negotiated sale late on Tuesday. The wheat supplier is United Grain Co of the United States,&quot; said a senior trader in an American commodity house.</p>
<p>Other details of the transaction were not given.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
